# fdfpv-ci@.service: one self-hosted runner slot for checks.yml's `node`
# job, on the owner's DESKTOP (a systemd --user unit, not on the VM).
# Installed by install.sh; instances fdfpv-ci@1 and fdfpv-ci@2. Each cycle
# of run-slot.sh is one container and one job, and Restart=always makes the
# next one.
#
# Stopping an instance stops its container with it, cancelling a job that
# is running there: retire a slot only when it is idle (README.md).
